<!--
    Vendor VINTF manifest — myron (POCO F8 Ultra / SM8850 sun)

    CRITICAL FIX (confirmed from logcat):
    ─────────────────────────────────────
    Lỗi gốc: IKeyMintDevice/default @3 được khai báo 2 lần:
      1) trong file này  (manifest.xml)
      2) trong manifest/android.hardware.security.keymint-service-qti.xml
    → hwservicemanager trả về -2147483648 khi parse VINTF
    → TẤT CẢ service registration fail theo cascade (health, boot-hal, weaver...)
    → Pin hiển thị 100%, boot-hal fail STATUS=-3, weaver không start

    Solution: Xóa keymint AIDL khỏi manifest.xml chính.
    Subfolder manifest/ sẽ được auto-merge bởi libvintf — không conflict.

    NOTE: android.hardware.keymaster@4.1 HIDL giữ lại vì:
    OFox R11.x/R12.x Keymaster_Ver() tìm entry này để detect decrypt path.
    Actual decrypt dùng KeyMint AIDL từ subfolder xml.
-->
<manifest version="2.0" type="device">
    <!-- OFox keymaster version detection — HIDL stub, NOT real service -->
    <hal format="hidl">
        <name>android.hardware.keymaster</name>
        <transport>hwbinder</transport>
        <version>4.1</version>
        <interface>
            <name>IKeymasterDevice</name>
            <instance>default</instance>
        </interface>
    </hal>

    <!-- Gatekeeper AIDL -->
    <hal format="aidl">
        <name>android.hardware.gatekeeper</name>
        <fqname>IGatekeeper/default</fqname>
    </hal>

    <!-- Secure Element AIDL -->
    <hal format="aidl">
        <name>android.hardware.secure_element</name>
        <fqname>ISecureElement/eSE1</fqname>
    </hal>
</manifest>
